  <item nodeId="node-0x56316c184640">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look at kingfisher</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">A magnificent bird, its feathers resplendent shades of deep blue and orange, with white flashes on its neck. You get a sense of deep wisdom in the kingfisher&apos;s eyes. It observes you expectantly, as if waiting for you to say something. 

&gt;</result>
