    <command xml:space="preserve">look at visage</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">A shattered visage, whose frown, and wrinkled lip, and sneer of cold command, tell that its sculptor well those passions read which yet survive, stamped on these lifeless things, the hand that mocked them, and the heart that fed.

