  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316ca804e0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Ozymandias
Two vast and trunkless legs of stone stand in the desert. Near them on the sand, half sunk, a shattered visage lies. The legs are atop a pedestal.

You can see a weasel here.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316ca83960"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316ca83960">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x weasel</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">A timid yet adorable mustelid scurries too and fro amongst the scattered stones. When she notices you she gives an excited yip and climbs up to the top of the pedestal and... speaks? &quot;Claire! come closer and talk to me. I don&apos;t have long.&quot;

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316ca87280"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316ca87280">
    <command xml:space="preserve">push button 1</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The weasel yips at you frantically, desperate to talk. you should do that before messing around with the control panel.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
