  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cb75840">
    <command xml:space="preserve">whisper sarruma</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The feather seems to glow dimly. Suddenly you are enveloped in ethereal light so bright that you are forced to close your eyes. When the light fades and you open your eyes again, you are elsewhere...

Mountain Overlook
You stand on the slope of a tall mountain. A sheer drop falls away to the southwest. Torrential rain hammers down all around you, leaving the stone floor dangerously slippery and soaking you to the bone. You can see the entrance to a cavern to the northeast,but the downpour has caused the mountain stream to expand into a hazardous deluge which is impossible to cross.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cb78ac0"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cb78ac0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">whisper sekhmet</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The feather seems to glow dimly. Suddenly you are enveloped in ethereal light so bright that you are forced to close your eyes. When the light fades and you open your eyes again, you are elsewhere...

Desert ruins
You find yourself in the midst of an arid desert, sand stretching all around you and continuing off towards the shimmering horizon while the relentless sun beats down upon you.

Some distance to the east is a stone ruin of some sort. It&apos;s difficult to make out from here.

Ahead of you to the north is the crumbling edifice of a once mighty fortress. The huge rusted iron doors, though ancient, look powerful and unyielding, filling you with a sense of foreboding.As you gaze in awe and wonder at the immeasurably ancient ruins, you notice a flurry of movement amongst the dunes. Suddenly a weasel bursts out of the sand and scurries away to the east.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cb7bcd0"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cb7bcd0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">whisper achlys</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The feather seems to glow dimly. Suddenly you are enveloped in ethereal light so bright that you are forced to close your eyes. When the light fades and you open your eyes again, you are elsewhere...

Calm in the Mist
You find yourself in a grassy clearing. The sun - or some simulacra of the sun - seems to be threatening to shine down through the mists, casting a wan glow onto a grassy mound in the centre of the clearing.

&gt;</result>
