  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cb933a0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">1</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">(Button 1)
The weasel yips at you frantically, desperate to talk. you should do that before messing around with the control panel.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
