    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cbcb920">
    <command xml:space="preserve">n</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You head through the huge iron doors into the tunnel beyond. Eventually the tunnel opens out into what appears to be an arena.

Arena of Champions
You stand inside a vast arena, and for a brief moment experience a vision of an ancient time, the stalls filled with thousands of people cheering on the mighty warriors who clashed on the sands. As suddenly as it appeared, the vision fades, and the stalls lie empty, filling the arena with an unsettling silence. A plinth of alabaster occupies the centre of the arena.

Snapping out of your reverie, you notice three ghostly figures standing motionless around the plinth. Atop the plinth is a green chest.

On the plinth is a green box (closed).

You can also see a ghost on the left of the plinth, a Ghost behind the plinth and a ghost on the right of the plinth here.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cbcec90"/>
    </children>
  </item>
