  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cbd5660">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x stands</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Row upon row of gently staggered seating; in its heyday, this arena could have seated the population of a small town. You can almost smell the aroma of mets cooking on stakes to sell to the audience, almost hear the slosh of wine and roars of applause...

&gt;</result>
