  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cc71850">
    <command xml:space="preserve">give malachite to ghost on the right</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The ghost takes the malachite and looks at it inquisitively. He holds it close. His expression does not change. &quot;This is worthless to me!&quot; he spits, &quot;why don&apos;t you give me something useful?.&quot; The ghost throws the malachite back at you. You pick it up and put it in your pocket.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
