  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cc9c670">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Mountain Overlook
You stand on the slope of a tall mountain. A sheer drop falls away to the southwest.  You can see the entrance to a cavern to the northeast, on the other side of a shallow mountain stream.

&gt;</result>
