  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cc9fb20">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x stream</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">A gentle stream flows over the rock between you and the cavern entrance before flowing over the edge of the cliff. There are various points where the water is shallow enough for you to hop across.

&gt;</result>
