  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cce8c40">
    <command xml:space="preserve">talk to kingfisher</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The kingfisher listens but makes no response. It seems to be listening for you to say a specific word.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
