  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cd06ff0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">read book</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">An old leather bound book titled &quot;The Four Goddesses of the Land&quot;. There seems to be some pages missing. You flip through the pages but it is written in a strange runic script. The only letters you recognise take the form of a handwritten note in the margins that reads &quot;FUTHORC&quot;

&gt;</result>
