  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cd2d040">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x door</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Vast and unyielding and impossibly ancient, you wonder who could have built this enormous portal. The doors must weigh hundreds of tons; they are covered in thick red rust but you detect no signs of corrosion or structural weakness.

&gt;</result>
