  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316ceb0850">
    <command xml:space="preserve">listen</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The sound of the rain and the roaring torrent of water in front of you are almost too much to bear.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316ceb73f0"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316ceb73f0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x sky</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Deep steel grey clouds fill the sky as they bleed water all over the mountains. It&apos;s difficult to seem more than a few metres in front of you, such is the density of the water. You feel cold.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316ceba8f0"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316ceba8f0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ne</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The stream has become a overflowing cascade.  Stepping into that would surely sweep you over the edge of the cliff. You briefly contemplate how long it would take you to fall to the bottom and decide you do not wish to find out.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cebde00"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cebde00">
    <command xml:space="preserve">yell stop raining</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You yell at the clouds, at the sky, at the very gods themselves, and miraculously (or coincidentally, depending on your viewpoint), they seem to listen. The rain eases, then stops. The clouds begin to break, revealing a beautiful fiery orange sunset to the southwest. Gradually, the mountain stream reduces in ferocity. The air feels incredibly still and you are overcome with a sense of tranquility.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cec1460"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cec1460">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x sky</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The clouds have cleared and the blue sky fades to a vibrant orange as the sun begins to set. Your former chill is replaced by an inner warmth and you smile as you take in the beauty.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cec49f0"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cec49f0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">listen</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You hear the sound of birdsong and the gentle rush of flowing water. There is a certain tranquility to the place that was absent during the storm.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cec7f30"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cec7f30">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ne</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">
Cavern
The cavern feels surprisingly cosy inside. Instead of bare rock, the walls are covered in a variety of tapestries and paintings. Hessian carpet covers the floor. Around the edges of the cavern walls are pieces of hand-crafted wooden furniture: a bed; a nightstand; a wardrobe. In the centre of the cavern, near a log burning stove, is a luxurious looking chair. An old man sits on the chair, looking out at the sunset to the southwest with a contented smile on his face.

On the chair is The Old Man of the Mountain.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cecb7e0"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cecb7e0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">yell win</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The rain has stopped; the mountains are peaceful. You see no reason to change that.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cecebe0"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cecebe0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ne</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You can&apos;t go that way.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
