  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316ced2000">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x tapestries</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Great woven masterpieces in a variety of vibrant colours. They add a nice warmth to the cavern. As you look more closely, you notice they appear to be telling a story of some sort, but there appear to be some sections missing.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316ced5480"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316ced5480">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x paintings</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">A variety of works in oil and acrylics. Some are abstract, some appear to be self-portraits of the old man at various stages in his life. The man in the paintings looks strangely familiar, and also rather handsome.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316ced8940"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316ced8940">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x painting</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You can&apos;t see any such thing.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
