    <command xml:space="preserve">x paintings</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">A variety of works in oil and acrylics. Some are abstract, some appear to be self-portraits of the old man at various stages in his life. The man in the paintings looks strangely familiar, and also rather handsome.

&gt;</result>
