    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316ceeff20">
    <command xml:space="preserve">tell man about ada lovelace</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">&quot;Ahhhh yes,&quot; says the old man, a wistful look in his eyes. &quot;One of my fondest memories. I kept her safe for a time. Showed her some of the things her inventions helped create. Here&apos;s some knowledge for you: Page 33.&quot;

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
