  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cef67f0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">tell man about macaroni cheese</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">&quot;Mmmmm macaroni cheese!&quot; The old man almost seems to salivate at the thought. &quot;Such a tasty dish. Why I remember the first time I made that for.... But I digress. Anyway here&apos;s your bit of knowledge in exchange: Page 75.&quot;

&gt;</result>
