  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf06f90">
    <command xml:space="preserve">whisper medeina</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The feather seems to glow dimly. Suddenly you are enveloped in ethereal light so bright that you are forced to close your eyes. When the light fades and you open your eyes again, you are elsewhere...

Forest Glade
You stand in a beautiful shaded forest glade. Wonderful gnarled old oak, beech and birch trees surround you on all sides, and you hear the comforting sounds of birdsong all around you. The sunlight filters through the canopy above, casting dappled shadows through the trees. An aura of peace seems to fill the place, and you start to feel your worries slipping away. A narrow path winds through the trees to the south.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cf0a650"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf0a650">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look at trees</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">A sea of vibrant greens and rich browns that just seems to go on and on forever. From your vantage point the forest appears to be endless.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cf0db20"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf0db20">
    <command xml:space="preserve">listen</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">the forest is alive with sound. Chittering birds, the screech of muntjac deer, and all manner of pattering in amongst the undergrowth, signalling the presence of a rich and vibrant tapestry of animal life. All the while, the gentle sway and rustle of the leaves in the wind brings a preternatural calm to your mind.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cf10ff0"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf10ff0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">s</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You follow the path through the trees. As you do you realise that you are flanked either side by the kingfisher and goldcrest from before. They fly on ahead of you as the trees open out into a clearing.

The Shepherd&apos;s hut
The path from the north opens out here into a shady clearing in the centre of the forest. In the shade of a great oak tree is a wooden hut, which might seem modest to a city-dweller but seems a nice place to live. In front of the hut is a firepit, above which hangs a solitary basket, presumably for cooking food. It doesn&apos;t seem like anyone has actually been here for a long time. As your gaze slowly moves across the area you notice the kingfisher and goldcrest take up positions above the entrance to the hut.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cf147e0"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf147e0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x tree</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">A mighty oak tree, its beautiful boughs laden with leaves and a wealth of acorns. You feel like this tree has witnessed many generations of people live out their days in its shade.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-0x56316cf17c60"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf17c60">
    <command xml:space="preserve">listen</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">the forest is alive with sound. Chittering birds, the screech of muntjac deer, and all manner of pattering in amongst the undergrowth, signalling the presence of a rich and vibrant tapestry of animal life. All the while, the gentle sway and rustle of the leaves in the wind brings a preternatural calm to your mind.

&gt;</result>
