  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf1b200">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x hut</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">This looks like it was possibly once mobile, tiny wheels still barely visible under the wooden cladding. Small steps lead up to an arched entrance, atop which is sat the kingfisher and the goldcrest. A thin line of smoke curls up out of the chimney.

&gt;</result>
