  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf1e850">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x firepit</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">A firepit containing some mostly-burned charcoal. A basket hangs above it, with a cauldron set atop for cooking. It doesn&apos;t look like it&apos;s been used in a while.

&gt;</result>
