  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf21cc0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">in</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">
Inside the Shepherd&apos;s Hut
As you enter the shepherd&apos;s hut, you freeze in place. The energy of this place feels markedly different to the forest outside. To the left, a raised platform houses a bed. To the right is a small log burner and kitchen area. But in the centre is the source of the strange energy. A swirling vortex of green energy encircles a woman with elfin features, apparently holding her in place. When she notices you, the elf woman lets out a cry of relief. &quot;Oh Claire! You found me! Oh thank the goddesses! I feared I might be trapped here forever! It&apos;s me, Ottelie!&quot;

You can see Ottelie here.

&gt;</result>
