  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf28aa0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x kitchen</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">A small kitchen area containing shelves stocked with reagents. It looks like the perfect place to base a puzzle involving the mixing of ingredients to reverse a spell. Ah well, maybe next time, eh?

&gt;</result>
