  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf2f7e0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x vortex</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">A woman with elfin features and a mischievous look in her eyes stands enmeshed is a swirling green vortex of magical energy. Vibrant orange hair is tied up with a ribbon of thorns, a beautiful contrast with the forest green dress that falls to her knees. White fabric wraps around her forearms and lower legs, offering some protection against the forest while still allowing a closeness to nature that heavier clothes would deny. You try to reach through the vortex to reach her but the magical barrier is all but impenetrable.

&gt;</result>
