  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf335f0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">talk to ottelie</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Ottelie looks at you rather sheepishly before saying &quot;I&apos;d really love to tell you that I was imprisoned here by some evil warlock or something, but... well... It&apos;s my own fault. I was brewing up some growth formula for the plants, and I guess I just wasn&apos;t really paying attention to what I was tossing in the cauldron and... I... kinda ended up casting a spell of binding?&quot; You stare back blankly, trying desperately to keep your face neutral. &quot;I can see the corners of your mouth moving,&quot; says Ottelie, &quot;It&apos;s not funny, OK? I&apos;ve been stuck like this for a week! I was able to escape by shape shifting into a weasel, but I was severely time limited. The birds have obviously been a big help... Are you laughing, Claire?&quot;

You cover your mouth to hide your grin and apologise profusely. &quot;Well OK I&apos;ll concede it is pretty hilarious now that I think about it,&quot; says Ottelie, &quot;but I still need to be rescued. The original plan was for you to try to brew up a potion to counteract the binding spell, using reagents in the kitchen area and brewing them int he cauldron outside, but it would appear that we ran out of time. So... I guess if you know any other ways of casting a spell to set me free, I&apos;m all ears.&quot;

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>NO</changed>
