  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf33170">
    <command xml:space="preserve">yell help</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You yell &quot;HELP!&quot; It feels somewhat cathartic, but ultimately futile.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
