  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf3a530">
    <command xml:space="preserve">yell free ottelie</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You yell at the top of your lungs &quot;FREE OTTELIE!&quot; This seems to catch Ottelie off guard,and she blinks at you with a stunned look on her face. &quot;I mean, I appreciate the effort, but there&apos;s no way that...&quot; The green light enveloping Ottelie starts to fade and dissipate, eventually completely disappearing. The atmosphere inside the shepherd&apos;s hut feels noticably less oppressive as Ottelie continues to stare at you. &quot;It... worked??? How the hell??? Who are you, Melchor the bloody Mystic or something? Well no matter. Thank you. There&apos;s one final thing left to do. Talk to me again once you&apos;re ready to wrap this whole thing up.

&gt;</result>
