  <item nodeId="node-0x56316cf44d80">
    <command xml:space="preserve">talk to ottelie</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Ottelie beams at you with a mischievous grin. &quot;Well I still can&apos;t believe that worked, but I am forever in your debt. I&apos;m not sure how much longer I could have survived off the food the birds brought me. Fish gives me an upset stomach and although I do love raspberries, I&apos;m not terribly convinced of their nutritional value.&quot; She closes her eyes and takes a deep breath. &quot;But it doesn&apos;t matter any more because I&apos;m free. And not a moment too soon either; there&apos;s a very unique astral alignment which means my world and yours will soon be joined. You get to meet me for real, Claire!&quot;

You take a step back, expressing disbelief. How can this be possible? As you open your mouth to speak, Ottelie raises her hands in supplication. &quot;Listen carefully, Claire. There is only a limited window. On the 23rd of October, 2026, you will be able to visit me in this very hut.&quot; As Ottelie finishes her sentence, you start to feel slightly woozy. You look at your hands and they appear almost transparent.

&quot;Oh no! it looks as if your time in my world is coming to an end,&quot; Ottelie smiles reassuringly, &quot;but don&apos;t worry. You have a solid GROUNDING in this world and your own. And although you have been through many ORDEALS, I think a rest is well DESERVED.&quot;

You fixate on the words Ottelie has spoken as you close your eyes and drift off into a peaceful sleep.



    *** You did it. All that remains is to find Ottelie at the time and place she suggested... ***



Would you like to RESTART, RESTORE a saved game, QUIT or UNDO the last command?
&gt; </result>
